            {'after': 5, 'q': "What happened after the old woman changed her mind and tried to follow the Wise Men?", 'options': ["She caught up with them just in time", "She found a different baby to give gifts to", "She turned back home immediately", "She could never find the right road to Bethlehem"], 'correct': 3},
            {'after': 6, 'q': "How does the legend explain the tradition of the stocking and the coal?", 'options': ["She leaves coal for all children as a reminder of her mistake", "The stocking tradition has nothing to do with her", "The Befana leaves sweets for good children and coal for mischievous ones", "She only gives gifts to children named after the Wise Men"], 'correct': 2},
